I worked on automating the end-to-end BGD intake process. Initially, we had three different patterns generating suspicious member lists, which could contain overlapping members. I automated the execution of these patterns, followed by a deduplication process to ensure that each member appears in only one final output file. Then, I automated the submission of these members to the BGD table using their respective BGD numbers. Finally, I integrated everything through Python and shell scripts and scheduled the complete workflow in Domino.
